=head1 DESCRIPTION

Contains details about items that were processed in all of the child
workflow executions that were started by a Map Run.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Aborted => Int

The total number of items processed in child workflow executions that
were either stopped by the user or by Step Functions, because the Map
Run failed.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Failed => Int

The total number of items processed in child workflow executions that
have failed.


=head2 FailuresNotRedrivable => Int

The number of C<FAILED>, C<ABORTED>, or C<TIMED_OUT> items in child
workflow executions that cannot be redriven because the execution
status of those child workflows is terminal. For example, child
workflows with an execution status of C<FAILED>, C<ABORTED>, or
C<TIMED_OUT> and a C<redriveStatus> of C<NOT_REDRIVABLE>.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Pending => Int

The total number of items to process in child workflow executions that
haven't started running yet.


=head2 PendingRedrive => Int

The number of unsuccessful items in child workflow executions currently
waiting to be redriven.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> ResultsWritten => Int

Returns the count of items whose results were written by
C<ResultWriter>. For more information, see ResultWriter
(https://docs.aws.amazon.com/step-functions/latest/dg/input-output-resultwriter.html)
in the I<Step Functions Developer Guide>.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Running => Int

The total number of items being processed in child workflow executions
that are currently in-progress.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Succeeded => Int

The total number of items processed in child workflow executions that
have completed successfully.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> TimedOut => Int

The total number of items processed in child workflow executions that
have timed out.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Total => Int

The total number of items processed in all the child workflow
executions started by a Map Run.



